      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for that. it's a good start, but i just checked the metrics for this draft and the score is way too low. the system flagged it as \"insufficiently comprehensive\" because of the low word count. \n\ncan you expand on this? i need the guide to be much more robust. go into more detail on each step—maybe explain *why* they are doing certain things or include more context about the network environment. just make sure the technical advice stays accurate, i don't want users getting confused, but we really need to bump that word count score up significantly to meet the department requirement.",
